          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nHowever, keeping in view the facts of matter, it is directed that in case the applicant moves an appropriate application for discharge within 45 days from today, the same shall be decided expeditiously in accordance with law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "122b2cceca9446858f99f8308a601b97_19",
        "summary_section": "decision",
